      <image type="source" xml:lang="pt-BR" width="940" height="1380">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rafatosta/gtasks/e7c5ab49619a71b377aa87a0e63919590e89850c/data/screenshots/compact-pt_BR.png</image>
